{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents22MISOTabBarViewModifierV","platforms":[{"beta":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOTabBarViewModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"MISOTabBarViewModifier","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOTabBarViewModifier","kind":"identifier"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"Defines the look and feel the tab bar must have by applying the MISO tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Changes only colors and typgraphies, and does not add additional items like indicator of selected tab or divider.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To use these elements in your tab view, use instead ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTabBar","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOTabBarViewModifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Rendering","text":"Rendering"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS 26 brings Liquid Glass, the new Apple look and feel which will prevent developers to define specific styles for some critical components like bars.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Because today the MISO tab bar relies on native component and is not designed from scratch, some elements will look different between iOS 26 and older versions:","type":"text"}]},{"ite